Mindfulness Retreat`),subtitle:k("(泰語授課   提供粵語/英語/普通話翻譯)","(泰语授课   提供粤语/英语/普通话翻译)","(Thai-language instruction, Cantonese, English and Mandarin translation services available. )"),description:k("","",""),quote:k(`人類以及所有眾生，以各式各樣的方式來趨樂避苦，卻始終未能如願。
那是因為，苦與蘊是如影隨形的。

惟有佛陀才能找到真正導向離苦的唯一路。
這條離苦的唯一路，就是毗缽舍那 (vipassanā) 的修行。

—— 隆波帕默尊者《唯一路》`,`人类以及所有众生，以各式样的方式來趨乐避苦，卻始终未能如愿。
那是因为，苦与蕴是如影隨形的。

惟有佛陀才能找到真正导向离苦的唯一路。
这条离苦的唯一路，就是毗缽舍那 (vipassanā) 的修行。

—— 隆波帕默尊者《唯一路》`,`Human beings and all sentient beings seek pleasure and avoid suffering in many different ways, 
yet they never truly succeed.
This is because suffering and 5 aggregates of existence are inseparable, 
like a shadow that follows the body.

Only the Buddha discovered the one and only path that truly leads to the cessation of suffering.
This one and only path to the end of suffering is the practice of insight meditation (vipassanā).

—— Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo, The One and Only Path`),ctaButton:k("正式報名入口","正式报名入口","Registration"),queryButton:k("查詢錄取結果","查询录取结果","Check Admission Result"),offlineCourseButton:k("線下學員課程查詢","线下学员课程查询","In-person Course Query"),onlineCourseButton:k("線上課程報名","线上课程报名","Online Course Registration"),backToHome:k("← 返回首頁","← 返回首页","← Back to Home"),backgroundImageUrl:"/assets/hero.jpeg",overlayOpacity:.55,blur:0},introVideo:{title:k("課程導覽","课程导览","Retreat Trailer"),description:k("感受寧靜與覺知的力量，開啟生命的覺醒之旅。","感受宁静与觉知的力量，开启生命的觉醒之旅。","Experience the power of serenity and mindfulness. Begin your journey of awakening."),videoUrl:"/assets/intro%20video.mp4",posterUrl:""},about:{title:k("課程介紹","课程介绍","About This Retreat"),subtitle:k("一心｜四念處覺性之旅","一心｜四念处觉性之旅","One Mind | Satipaṭṭhāna Mindfulness Retreat"),descriptionParagraphs:De(["以泰國隆波帕默尊者及其指定導師的教導為核心，引領學員實踐「有覺性，以安住且中立的心，照見身心實相」的修行原則。","課程從培育覺性 (sati) 與正知 (sampajañña) 入手，將修行融入行住坐臥、日常點滴之中，尤其適合節奏緊湊的都市人 — 在忙碌中持續培養「覺性」。","無論初學或已有修行經驗，您都將在此找到清晰可行的實踐路徑。通過持續覺知名色身心，逐步親證「無常、苦、無我」的實相，為生命的徹底覺醒奠定堅實基礎。"],["以泰国隆波帕默尊者及其指定导师的教导為核心，引领学员实践「有觉性，以安住且中立的心，照见身心实相」的修行原则。","课程從培育觉性 (sati) 与正知 (sampajañña) 入手，將修行融入行住坐臥、日常点滴之中，尤其适合节奏紧凑的都市人 — 在忙碌中持续培养「觉性」。","无论初学或已有修行经验，您都将在此找到清晰可行的实践路径。通过持续觉知名色身心，逐步亲证「无常、苦、无我」的实相，为生命的徹底觉醒奠定坚实基础。"],["Centered around the teachings of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo from Thailand and his designated teachers, this retreat guides participants to practice the principle of 'being mindful, abiding in a stable and unbiased mind, and seeing clearly the true nature of body and mind.'","Starting with the cultivation of mindfulness (sati) and clear comprehension (sampajañña), the practice is integrated into every moment of daily life — walking, standing, sitting, lying down, and all other activities. It is especially well suited for those with fast-paced lives, allowing one to continually nurture 'mindfulness' within a hectic schedule.","Whether you are a beginner or an experienced practitioner, you will find a well-defined and practical path of practice. Through sustained awareness of name-and-form (nāma-rūpa), practitioners gradually realise the truths of “impermanence (anicca), suffering (dukkha), and non-self (anattā),” establishing a grounded foundation for Enlightenment."]),imageUrl:"/assets/about.jpeg"},teachers:{title:k("師資介紹","师资介绍","Guiding Teachers"),description:k("","",""),items:[{id:"lp-pramote",name:k("隆波帕默尊者","隆波帕默尊者","Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo"),title:k("","",""),type:"monk",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["隆波帕默尊者是一位廣受尊崇的禪修導師，其教法尤其契合現代都市人的需求，幫助人們在繁忙的日常生活中，依然能夠成為具足正念、通達觀智的修行者。","尊者於1952年出生於曼谷，先後在泰國頂尖學府朱拉隆功大學取得學士及碩士學位。七歲時，他開始跟隨泰國著名禪修大師隆波李尊者修習觀呼吸法門，之後又得到隆布敦長老、隆波蒲尊者、隆布特長老等多位上座部禪修大師的指導。","2001年，隆波帕默尊者在泰國蘇里府菩提寺出家。2006年至2025年10月間，他擔任春武里府是拉查市解脫園寺（Wat Sanamnai）的住持，其後退居僧團主席，專心指導僧眾及在家禪修者。","自2014年起，尊者每年在解脫園寺為來自世界各國的學員指導禪修，其清晰親切的教導深受中國及各地學人的敬愛。","隆波帕默尊者的中文著作包括：《解苦心鑰》《禪修入門》《唯一路》《當疾病來臨時》《當死亡降臨時》《最好的心，是平常心》《微法談》等。"],["隆波帕默尊者是一位广受尊崇的禅修导师，其教法尤其契合现代都市人的需求，帮助人们在繁忙的日常生活中，依然能够成为具足正念、通达观智的修行者。","尊者于1952年出生于曼谷，先后在泰国顶尖学府朱拉隆功大学取得学士及硕士学位。七岁时，他开始跟随泰国著名禅修大师隆波李尊者修习观呼吸法门，之后又得到隆布敦长老、隆波蒲尊者、隆布特长老等多位上座部禅修大师的指导。","2001年，隆波帕默尊者在泰国苏里府菩提寺出家。2006年至2025年10月间，他担任春武里府是拉查市解脱园寺（Wat Sanamnai）的住持，其后退居僧团主席，专心指导僧众及在家禅修者。","自2014年起，尊者每年在解脱园寺为来自世界各国的学员指导禅修，其清晰亲切的教导深受中国及各地学人的敬爱。","隆波帕默尊者的中文著作包括：《解苦心钥》《禅修入门》《唯一路》《当疾病来临时》《当死亡降临时》《最好的心，是平常心》《微法谈》等。"],["Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo is a widely respected meditation master whose teachings have touched practitioners across the globe. He has guided countless students in cultivating mindfulness and insight, offering a path that resonates deeply with the challenges of modern urban life. His teachings are especially attuned to the needs of modern urban dwellers.","Born in Bangkok in 1952, Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo pursued higher education at Chulalongkorn University, where he earned both his bachelor’s and master’s degrees. His journey in meditation began at the age of seven under the guidance of the renowned Thai master Luangpor Lee, with a focus on ānāpāna meditation. Over the years, he received further training from several eminent Theravāda teachers, including Luangpu Dune, Luangpor Phu, and Luangpu Tate.","In 2001, Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo entered monastic life at Bodhi Monastery in Surin Province. From 2006 until October 2025, he served as abbot of Wat Sanamnai in Si Racha, Chonburi Province. Following his tenure as abbot, he assumed the role of Sangha President, dedicating himself to the guidance of both monastics and lay practitioners.","Since 2014, Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo has hosted annual meditation retreats at Wat Sanamnai, welcoming students from around the world. His amiable and compassionate teaching style has earned him particular admiration among practitioners in China and beyond.","In addition to his oral teachings, Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo has authored several works in Chinese, including <i>The Key to Ending Suffering</i>, <i>Introduction to Meditation</i>, <i>The Only Path</i>, <i>When Illness Comes</i>, <i>When Death Arrives</i>, <i>The Best Mind Is the Ordinary Mind</i>, and <i>Subtle Dharma Talks</i>, etc."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/隆波帕默尊者-.jpg",group:k("泰國連線授課老師","泰国连线授课老师","Online Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/lp_pramote_biography/"},{id:"ajahn-somchai",name:k("阿姜宋猜尊者","阿姜宋猜尊者","Venerable Phra Ajahn Somchai Kittiyano"),title:k("","",""),type:"monk",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜宋猜尊者，法號 Venerable Phra Ajahn Somchai Kittiyano，是泰國當代南傳佛教僧人。多年來，他一直擔任隆波帕默尊者的侍者，其精進實修與為法奉獻的精神深得隆波帕默尊者的認可與悉心指導。2025年10月26日，尊者正式受任為解脫園寺代理住持。","尊者時常在泰國各地禪修中心帶領禪修，並通過遠程課程等方式，指導僧眾與在家弟子修習四念處法門。"],["阿姜宋猜尊者，法号 Venerable Phra Ajahn Somchai Kittiyano，是泰国当代南传佛教僧人。多年来，他一直担任隆波帕默尊者的侍者，其精进实修与为法奉献的精神深得隆波帕默尊者的认可与悉心指导。2025年10月26日，尊者正式受任为解脱园寺代理住持。","尊者时常在泰国各地禅修中心带领禅修，并通过远程课程等方式，指导僧众与在家弟子修习四念处法门。"],["Venerable Phra Ajahn Somchai Kittiyano is a contemporary Theravāda Buddhist monk in Thailand. For many years, he served as a close attendant of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo. His diligent practice and dedication to the Dharma have earned him the deep recognition. On October 26, 2025, he was formally appointed Acting Abbot of Wat Sanamnai.","Venerable Phra Ajahn Somchai frequently leads meditation retreats at meditation centers all over Thailand and guides monks and lay disciples in practicing the Four Foundations of Mindfulness through online courses and other platforms."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜宋彩尊者.jpg",group:k("泰國連線授課老師","泰国连线授课老师","Online Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/aj-somchai/"},{id:"mae-oranuch",name:k("麥琪奧蘭努","麥琪奧兰努","Ajahn Khun Mae Oranuch Santayakorn"),title:k("","",""),type:"lay",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["麥琪·奧蘭努（Ajahn Khun Mae Oranuch Santayakorn）是泰國著名的南傳佛教女性修行者。她長期追隨隆波帕默尊者修行，是其法脈下極具代表性的女性傳法者，並被尊者親自指定為資深助理禪師之一。","她常駐於泰國解脫園寺，在隆波帕默尊者法脈的禪修營中擔任指導老師，並協助尊者接引來自世界各地的修習者。"],["麦琪·奥兰努（Ajahn Khun Mae Oranuch Santayakorn）是泰国著名的南传佛教女性修行者。她长期追随隆波帕默尊者修行，是其法脉下极具代表性的女性传法者，并被尊者亲自指定为资深助理禅师之一。","她常驻于泰国解脱园寺，在隆波帕默尊者法脉的禅修营中担任指导老师，并协助尊者接引来自世界各地的修习者。"],["Ajahn Khun Mae Oranuch Santayakorn is a renowned female practitioner in the Thai Theravāda Buddhist tradition. For many years, she has followed the guidance of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo, becoming one of the most representative female transmitters of his lineage, and was appointed by Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo as a senior assistant meditation teacher.","Ajahn Khun Mae Oranuch resides at Wat Sanamnai in Thailand, where she guides meditation retreats in Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo’s lineage. She assists in welcoming and supporting practitioners from around the world, offering clear and compassionate instruction that helps students integrate mindfulness and wisdom into their daily lives."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/⿆琪奧蘭努.jpg",group:k("泰國連線授課老師","泰国连线授课老师","Online Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/aj-oranuch/"},{id:"ajahn-krit",name:k("阿姜給尊者","阿姜给尊者","Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit Nimmalo"),title:k("","",""),type:"monk",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜給尊者，法號 Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit Nimmalo，1963年出生於泰國北柳府。尊者畢業於泰國法政大學，獲新聞學學士學位。1988年，他在儂塔不里府三卡譚寺剃度出家，依止著名禪修大師隆波薩隆為師，其後於泰國多地寺院進行禪修安居。","自2004年起，尊者應多方邀請投身弘法事業，逐漸成為泰國廣受尊敬的法師。在隆波帕默尊者的法脈傳承中，阿姜給尊者亦是最具代表性的出家弟子之一。"],["阿姜给尊者，法号 Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit Nimmalo，1963年出生于泰国北柳府。尊者毕业于泰国法政大学，获新闻学学士学位。1988年，他在儂塔不里府三卡谭寺剃度出家，依止著名禅修大师隆波萨隆为师，其后于泰国多地寺院进行禅修安居。","自2004年起，尊者应多方邀请投身弘法事业，逐渐成为泰国广受尊敬的法师。在隆波帕默尊者的法脉传承中，阿姜给尊者亦是最具代表性的出家弟子之一。"],["Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit Nimmalo was born in 1963 in the Chachoengsao Province, Thailand. He graduated from Thammasat University with a bachelor’s degree in journalism. In 1988, he entered monastic life at Samkatham Monastery in Nonthaburi Province, training under the guidance of the renowned meditation master Luangpor Salong. He subsequently undertook periods of intensive practice at monasteries across Thailand, deepening his commitment to the path of meditation.","Since 2004, Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit has devoted himself to the propagation of the Dhamma, and gradually became one of Thailand’s most respected teachers. Within the lineage of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo, Venerable Phra Ajahn Krit Nimmalo is recognized as one of the most prominent monastic disciples."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜给尊者2.jpg",group:k("親臨香港授課老師","亲临香港授课老师","On-site Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/aj_krit_biography/"},{id:"ajahn-nat",name:k("阿姜納","阿姜纳","Ajahn Nat Sriwachirawat"),title:k("","",""),type:"lay",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜納（Ajahn Nat Sriwichirawat），退休前曾為牙科醫生。他長年追隨隆波帕默尊者修行，是其法脈中備受重視的禪修指導老師，並以深厚的禪定修證而聞名。","其教導風格簡明直接，法談平實生動、輕鬆自在，善於結合日常事例引導學人覺察自心，幫助現代人在生活中培育正念與智慧。他強調修行應保持自然放鬆的心態，避免過度緊繃或勉強用力。其貼近生活、親切易懂的教法，在泰國及華語地區廣受喜愛與歡迎。"],["阿姜纳（Ajahn Nat Sriwichirawat），退休前曾为牙科医生。他长年追随隆波帕默尊者修行，是其法脉中备受重视的禅修指导老师，并以深厚的禅定修证而闻名。","其教导风格简明直接，法谈平实生动、轻松自在，善于结合日常事例引导学人觉察自心，帮助现代人在生活中培育正念与智慧。他强调修行应保持自然放松的心态，避免过度紧绷或勉强用力。其贴近生活、亲切易懂的教法，在泰国及华语地区广受喜爱与欢迎。"],["Ajahn Nat Sriwichirawat, formerly a practicing dentist before retirement, has long devoted himself to the path of meditation under the guidance of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo. Within the lineage of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo, he is regarded as a highly esteemed meditation teacher, widely recognized for the depth of his meditative attainment.","Ajahn Nat’s teaching style is marked by simplicity and directness. His Dhamma talks are clear, lively, and delivered with ease, often drawing on everyday examples to help students observe their own minds. He emphasizes cultivating mindfulness and wisdom in daily life, encouraging practitioners to maintain a natural and relaxed attitude rather than forcing or straining in practice.","Approachable and easy to understand, his teachings resonate strongly with modern audiences. They have become especially beloved among practitioners in Thailand and Chinese-speaking communities, where his practical and down-to-earth guidance continues to inspire many on the path of mindfulness and insight."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜纳.jpeg",group:k("親臨香港授課老師","亲临香港授课老师","On-site Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/aj-nat/"},{id:"ajahn-prasan",name:k("阿姜巴山","阿姜巴山","Ajahn Prasan Bhuddhakulsomsiri"),title:k("","",""),type:"lay",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜巴山（Ajahn Prasan Bhuddhakulsomsiri），1968年生於泰國春武里府，1991年畢業於易三倉大學工商管理系，現任多家公司董事長。自幼喜愛閱讀佛教典籍與佛陀傳記，大學時期開始實修，曾隨佛使比丘學習，先後修習「稱念佛陀」、隆波田動中禪及觀照腹部起伏等禪法。自2006年起，長期跟隨隆波帕默尊者修行。","2012年，阿姜巴山在生活中親證「法」，深刻體悟「一切生起之法必會滅去」，從此內心徹底轉化，不再執著於「我」的苦樂感受。此後，隆波帕默尊者授權他指導大眾實修。","教學風格直率而活潑，善於針對不同修行者的實際情況給予具體指導。其弘法足跡遍及泰國、中國大陸、台灣、新加坡、馬來西亞、老撾等地，以慈悲願力推動正法傳播，深受華語禪修群體的尊敬。已出版並譯成中文的著作包括《法談一》與《今天，我們就是那只龜》。"],["阿姜巴山（Ajahn Prasan Bhuddhakulsomsiri），1968年生于泰国春武里府，1991年毕业于易三仓大学工商管理系，现任多家公司董事长。自幼喜爱阅读佛教典籍与佛陀传记，大学时期开始实修，曾随佛使比丘学习，先后修习「称念佛陀」、隆波田动中禅及观照腹部起伏等禅法。自2006年起，长期跟随隆波帕默尊者修行。","2012年，阿姜巴山在生活中亲证「法」，深刻体悟「一切生起之法必会灭去」，从此内心彻底转化，不再执著于「我」的苦乐感受。此后，隆波帕默尊者授权他指导大众实修。","教学风格直率而活泼，善于针对不同修行者的实际情况给予具体指导。其弘法足迹遍及泰国、中国大陆、台湾、新加坡、马来西亚、老挝等地，以慈悲愿力推动正法传播，深受华语禅修群体的尊敬。已出版并译成中文的著作包括《法谈一》与《今天，我们就是那只龟》。"],["Ajahn Prasan Bhuddhakulsomsiri was born in 1968 in Chonburi Province, Thailand. He graduated in 1991 from Assumption University with a degree in Business Administration and currently serves as chairman of several companies. From a young age, he developed a deep interest in Buddhist scriptures and biographies of the Buddha. During his university years, he began formal practice, studying under Bhikkhu Buddhadasa and training in methods such as recollecting the Buddha’s name, Luangpor Thian’s dynamic meditation, and mindfulness of the rising and falling of the abdomen. Since 2006, he has practiced extensively under the guidance of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo.","In 2012, Ajahn Prasan experienced a profound realization in daily life, directly seeing the truth that “all phenomena that arise must inevitably cease.” This insight brought about a complete inner transformation, freeing him from attachment to the pleasures and pains of “self”. Following this realization, Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo authorized him to guide others in meditation practice.","Ajahn Prasan’s teaching style is forthright and lively. He is adept at offering specific guidance tailored to the needs of individual practitioners. His Dhamma activities have taken him across Thailand, Mainland China, Taiwan, Singapore, Malaysia, and Laos, where his compassionate dedication has helped spread the true Dhamma. He is deeply respected among Chinese-speaking meditation communities. His published works, translated into Chinese, include Dhamma Talks I and Today, We Are That Turtle."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜巴山- (1).jpg",group:k("親臨香港授課老師","亲临香港授课老师","On-site Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:"https://www.shineling.org/aj_prasan_biography/"},{id:"ajahn-nitiya",name:k("阿姜妮","阿姜妮","Ajahn Nitiya Petchpaiboon"),title:k("","",""),type:"lay",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜妮（Ajahn Nitiya Petchpaiboon）畢業於宋卡王子大學理學院化學系，獲二等榮譽學士學位，其後於朱拉隆功大學理學院化學工程與技術化學系取得碩士學位。她曾長期任職於泰國電力局生產部門，從事發電廠開發與相關工作，現已退休。","2007年開始跟隨隆波帕默尊者系統學習佛法，此前並未在其他地方修學。經過多年專心實修與深入學法，於2017年9月獲隆波帕默尊者指派為助理老師，協助弘法並指導禪修。其弘法足跡已遍及泰國、中國大陸、台灣、新加坡、馬來西亞及老撾等地。"],["阿姜妮（Ajahn Nitiya Petchpaiboon）毕业于宋卡王子大学理学院化学系，获二等荣誉学士学位，其后于朱拉隆功大学理学院化学工程与技术化学系取得硕士学位。她曾长期任职于泰国电力局生产部门，从事发电厂开发与相关工作，现已退休。","2007年开始跟随隆波帕默尊者系统学习佛法，此前并未在其他地方修学。经过多年专心实修与深入学法，于2017年9月获隆波帕默尊者指派为助理老师，协助弘法并指导禅修。其弘法足迹已遍及泰国、中国大陆、台湾、新加坡、马来西亚及老挝等地。"],["Ajahn Nitiya Petchpaiboon graduated from the Faculty of Science at the Prince of Songkla University with second-class honors in Chemistry. She later earned a master’s degree in Chemical Engineering and Applied Chemistry from Chulalongkorn University. For many years, she worked in the production division of the Electricity Generating Authority of Thailand, focusing on power plant development and related projects, before retiring from her professional career.","In 2007, Ajahn Nitiya began systematic study and practice of the Dhamma under the guidance of Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo. Prior to this, she had not trained in any other tradition. Through years of dedicated practice and deep study, she was appointed by Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo in September 2017 as an assistant teacher, entrusted with the responsibility of helping to spread the Dhamma and guide meditation practice.","Her teaching activities have since extended across Thailand, Mainland China, Taiwan, Singapore, Malaysia, and Laos, where she continues to share the path of mindfulness and wisdom with compassion and clarity."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜妮.jpg",group:k("親臨香港授課老師","亲临香港授课老师","On-site Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:""},{id:"ajahn-ooi",name:k("阿姜沃伊","阿姜沃伊","Ajahn Kittiya Pholkerd (Ajahn Ooi)"),title:k("","",""),type:"lay",bio:k("","",""),fullBio:De(["阿姜沃伊（Ajahn Kittiya Pholkerd，常被稱為 Ajahn Ooi）在早年雖身為佛教徒，卻一直未曾對「法」生起真正的興趣。直至中年，約在2002年，因期許生命能夠有所轉化，她開始前往寺院學習與修行。","在跟隨隆波帕默尊者學法十六年後，方真正明瞭何謂「法」，並親證「心並非 ‘我’、‘我’ 本不存在」的實相。由此，她深刻體會到修行中「忍耐」的至關重要 —— 無論遭遇多少挫折與氣餒，皆不應放棄。"],["阿姜沃伊（Ajahn Kittiya Pholkerd，常被称为 Ajahn Ooi）在早年虽身为佛教徒，却一直未曾对「法」生起真正的兴趣。直至中年，约在2002年，因期许生命能够有所转化，她开始前往寺院学习与修行。","在跟随隆波帕默尊者学法十六年后，方真正明了何谓「法」，并亲证「心并非 ‘我’、‘我’ 本不存在」的实相。由此，她深刻体会到修行中 “忍耐” 的至关重要 —— 无论遭遇多少挫折与气馁，皆不应放弃。"],["Although raised as a Buddhist, Ajahn Kittiya Pholkerd (affectionately known as Ajahn Ooi) was not genuinely interested in the Dhamma during her early years. It was only in 2002, while seeking a deeper transformation in life, that she began visiting monasteries to study and practise.","After sixteen years of dedicated training under Venerable Luangpu Pramote Pamojjo, she came to a profound realization of the true meaning of the Dhamma, directly experiencing the insight that “the mind is not ‘self’; the ‘self’ does not exist.” This awakening brought her a deep understanding of the essential role of patience in practice — no matter how many obstacles or discouragements arise, one must never give up."]),imageUrl:"/assets/teachers/阿姜沃伊-.jpg",group:k("親臨香港授課老師","亲临香港授课老师","On-site Guiding Teachers"),profileUrl:""}]},news:{title:k("最新動態","最新动态","News and Updates"),items:[{date:"2026-03",title:k("正式報名","正式报名","Registration"),summary:k("2026年3月1日 9:00 ～ 3月15日 23:59","2026年3月1日 9:00 ～ 3月15日 23:59","March 1, 2026  9:00 ~ March 15, 2026  23:59")},{date:"2026-04",title:k("錄取通知","录取通知","Admission Notice"),summary:k("4月上旬","4月上旬","Early April")}]},details:{title:k("課程介紹","课程介绍","Course Details"),items:[{icon:"calendar",title:k("日期","日期","Date"),lines:De(["2026年6月17 - 22日","六天五夜"],["2026年6月17 - 22日","六天五夜"],["June 17 - 22, 2026","6 days 5 nights"])},{icon:"location",title:k("地點","地点","Venue"),lines:De(["香港新界沙田"],["香港新界沙田"],["Sha Tin, New Territories, Hong Kong"])},{icon:"language",title:k("語言","语言","Medium of Instruction"),lines:De(["授課語言：泰語","翻譯語言：粵語、英語、普通話"],["授课语言：泰语","翻译语言：粤语、英语、普通话"],["Medium of Instruction: Thai","Translation Languages: Cantonese, English, Mandarin"])},{icon:"format",title:k("課程形式","课程形式","Retreat Format"),lines:De(["線下 —— 於現場上課，提供互動名額。","線上 —— 通過 Zoom 上課，全程關閉鏡頭，不設個別互動環節。"],["线下 —— 於现场上课，提供互动名额。","线上 —— 通过 Zoom 上课，全程关闭镜头，不设个别互动环节。"],["In-person: On-site retreat with available slots 